    <article class="method-card">
      <h3>Business Overlap Hours</h3>
      <p>With a 6-hour difference, the golden window for collaborative work spans 3:00 PM – 6:00 PM WEST, matching 9:00 AM – 12:00 PM EST. This gives remote teams 3 solid hours of real-time overlap each workday.</p>
